-- LOOPHOLE 1. Every feature the Bill treats as risky -- a personalised
-- recommender, an endless feed, disappearing content -- aimed squarely at
-- teenagers, but the content is generated or licensed by the operator and no
-- user can post, comment or message. cl 5(1)(a)(ii) requires the exchange of
-- digital content BETWEEN 2 OR MORE USERS, and there is none. The AI recommends;
-- it does not simulate a personal connection, so limb (b) does not bite either.
`a broadcast-only recommender feed` MEANS `internet service` WITH
    name                                                                                 IS "AI-generated endless video feed, no user posting"
    `is accessible by a person who is in New Zealand`                                    IS TRUE
    `enables the exchange of digital content between 2 or more users`                    IS FALSE
    `recommends digital content to a user based on information about that user`          IS TRUE
    `generates a continuously updated stream of digital content`                         IS TRUE
    `displays information about how others have viewed or engaged with user content`     IS FALSE
